				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					845a23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ὅρασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.37
				</span></i>
			: metaph. of anger, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.68
			</span></i> W.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be blinded,</i>
