				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					1.17
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήμασι πολλοῖς ὑπό τινων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					20.6.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>cut out the bud</i> of a tree, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.529b
			</span></i>. </div>
